  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/WORLD_WAR_Z/MP_WORLD_WAR_Z_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">世界已然淪陷。人類瀕臨滅絕，唯有最強者方能倖存。蒐集武器、構築庇護所，在戰火蹂躪與殘酷的環境中迎戰無盡的殭屍屍潮。你能堅持多少天才倒下？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/WORLD_WAR_Z/MP_WORLD_WAR_Z_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">World War Z 是一款末日生存整合包，戰爭與殭屍在此交織成殘酷的挑戰。這不僅僅是一個我的世界：在疫情摧毀一切後，你必須在混亂中持續掙扎求生。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🧟 毫不留情的殭屍屍潮，每日變得更強壯、數量更龐大。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🔫 槍械與軍事裝備，對抗感染的必備利器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🪖 防禦系統與先進裝甲，抵禦大規模攻擊。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🏚️ 極限生存：你必須蒐集資源、保衛基地，並盡可能延長存活時間。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">🌍 充滿敵意與荒蕪的世界，遍布廢墟城市、隱密庇護所與感染區域。</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">你的任務很簡單：在殭屍末日中盡可能長久地活下去。<br>每一天都至關重要。每一顆子彈都彌足珍貴。每一個決定都可能成為你的最後抉擇。</span></div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>準備好與朋友一同遊玩了嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore%253fr%253dworldwarz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/WORLD_WAR_Z/MP_WORLD_WAR_Z_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"353\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\">現在就建立你自己的我的世界伺服器，與好友們展開史詩般的冒險！享受強大的運算效能、穩定的連線時間以及無後顧之憂的體驗。別忘了輸入優惠碼&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">VOXELCORE </a>，即可為你的伺服器享有 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fvoxelcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">25% 折扣</a>！</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/WORLD_WAR_Z/MP_WORLD_WAR_Z_Screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1339669/description_fc9efefe-fbef-4d76-9371-c658e72532d1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1339669/description_e9aa65af-73c3-4566-96c4-2943bb9f5dca.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1339669/description_801653db-6655-4dfb-9cb2-1e950e25ae00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4qZvzDYgGT\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/WORLD_WAR_Z/MP_WORLD_WAR_Z_Discord.webp\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></span></span></strong></a></p>",
